And I'm not sure that this episode is 100% from this story.

266
00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:46.690
But I like to think it was a little bit inspired.

267
00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:52.310
So I was working at 1-800-DENIS in my early 20s, which was just yesterday, Jenna.

268
00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:53.270
Really, right?

269
00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:54.150
Yeah, it really was.

270
00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:54.910
Just yesterday.

271
00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:55.570
Yeah.

272
00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:58.110
And we had a man.

273
00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:02.390
He went into the women's restroom and kind of hid out in the women's restroom.

274
00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.050
And then when women would go in there, he would flash them.

275
00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:06.730
And...

276
00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:07.370
Who was he?

277
00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:08.230
We don't know.

278
00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:10.170
He was like some guy from the street.

279
00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:11.990
He was like, went in the women's restroom.

280
00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:12.550
But I don't...

281
00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:14.050
Okay, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

282
00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:15.290
Wait, how did he...

283
00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:16.970
Where were your...

