00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.950
Did 1-800-DENIS not have their own dedicated bathroom?

285
00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:22.150
Was it like a whole building bathroom?

286
00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:23.290
No, it was a whole building.

287
00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:25.010
Yes, it was a whole building.

288
00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:28.030
And several businesses, you know, the bathrooms were in the hallway.

289
00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:28.950
You know what I mean?

290
00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:29.290
Shared bathroom.

291
00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:29.970
Yeah, yeah.

292
00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:30.390
Okay.

293
00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.050
Like when I go to a doctor's office.

294
00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:33.670
Exactly, exactly.

295
00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:34.190
Okay.

296
00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:36.910
Yeah, this guy, he came in off the street.

297
00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:41.090
And he flashed one of the ladies when she went into the bathroom.

298
00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:46.010
And she came running out and came in the office and was like, I just got flashed.

299
00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:50.870
And oh my gosh, 1-800-DENIS obviously took this very seriously.

300
00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:54.930
And they implemented a whole new security system for our office.

301
00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:58.210
Okay, we are talking to people about their teeth.

302
00:11:58.450 --> 00:11:59.550
That's all we are doing.

303
00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.210
We're talking to people about their teeth.

304
00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:02.970
But guess what our security system was?

305
00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:04.510
Guess what the upgrade was?

306
00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:05.190
What?

307
00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:08.410
They scanned all of our fingerprints.

308
00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:16.250
And when we got to work, there was a scanner that you put your hand on that opened up to our hallway.

309
00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:17.790
Oh.

310
00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.310
I put my hand there and it would go bling, bling.

311
00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:23.050
Angela Kinsey admitted.

312
00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:24.890
Wow.

313
00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:25.450
Yeah.

314
00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.530
All because of the flasher.

315
00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:28.030
Yeah.

316
00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:35.250
But anyway, I told the writers that we had a flasher at work and it caused all this big hullabaloo.

317
00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:39.330
And you know, I just like to think that went on a note card on the wall somewhere.

318
00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:40.890
I want to give you credit for that.

319
00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:41.950
Oh, well, thanks.

320
00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:43.270
I like it.

321
00:12:44.090 --> 00:12:44.590
All right.

