We ate lunch there.

474
00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:30.630
They set up the catering.

475
00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:35.390
And then we also were able to bring in our own cars to do that scene with Meredith.

476
00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:35.970
Yeah.

477
00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:36.510
Parking.

478
00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:37.550
Yeah.

479
00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:40.330
But we really just spent the whole day at the mall.

480
00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:41.130
We really did.

481
00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:42.830
We really did.

